# The image people open: a shell, its text tools, the terminal, curl, amy, ps,
# the page's file exchange and its popups (html).
# It holds no compiler; amy installs what a session needs, and has nena
# enable the host modules a package needs beyond these (nena@0).
INSTALL /v0.1.5/Dollyfile-core 7205c35aed897514d3094f14a194669f73c295b4dd0213619d90155da8467cde
INSTALL /v0.1.5/Dollyfile-posix a98de8b50ce0a29e867194e9fe9c44a54c0ea48ccf25a0f1353431daf827cf9e
INSTALL /v0.1.5/Dollyfile-display 2032dbc473505507c7419267f43fdb2fe76b16b0907ca27f2b157a0ec54bda35
INSTALL /v0.1.5/Dollyfile-curl f31998555b9cca60e8ad5d7e6b5d8476aa119ecefbdc186f04461edad59f9e7d
INSTALL /v0.1.5/Dollyfile-amy e028eb4c7768642948f7adb64ed5932d36bf85c8c0879b0203c5e59ccc1d2d39
INSTALL /v0.1.5/Dollyfile-nena c02109a066ce2bf5c791ae4805fae4a29130b029a23276738069bde61be08175
